type: software
abstract: >-
  Reversible JSON-to-JSON transformation for the EnerPlanET platform: a Go
  package and command line tool that convert one JSON structure into another
  from a declarative mapping configuration and back again, shipped with the
  mapping from an EnerPlanET calculation payload to a MEME job.
